tracks in amazement...  You have entered a cavernous room, replete with Gothic
archways and stained-glass windows depicting battles, hunting parties, ocean
waves, hangman's gibbets and other scenes where Death may appear.  A huge
throne of onyx stands before you, and seated upon it is Death himself.  @CA
leather-bound book hovers in midair before you.@n
"
