#33752
"Room of the Shimmering Portal"
"You stand before a shimmering portal filled with flittering images, giving you
a whirlwind tour of The Forest's Edge.  Chiiron, Medienne, Voaleth, and all
the other cities flash fleetingly across the view of the portal.  Inscribed
along the arch of the portal are the keywords which, when told to the portal,
will instantly teleport the speaker to the place of his choice.  Who knows
what remains of the souls who told the portal a false destination.....
"
""
