#33756
"The Halls of Death"
"You are in a very large room where countless skeletons and ghosts shuffle
about doing administrative tasks.  Some appear to be writing scrolls though,
if you look closely, the writing is strange and so faint you really can't make
anything legible out.  Others appear to be carrying burdens from one place to
another and often they wink into or out of existence without any sign of
transport.  Whenever you get close enough to interact with any of these
things, they seem to disapear from sight as if eluding contact with you.  A
long, narrow plush carpet of black lined on either side with embroidered
lilies stretches from the large, gothic arch in the southern wall to the
larger gothic arch in the northern wall.
"
"room 43279 comes here
